<p>Waaqayat e karbala hum kya suaayein aapko<br />
Rote hai mehdi imam har wo din har raat ko</p>

<p>1. Kaisa dulha kaisi dulhan, kaisi ye shaadi huwi<br />
Karbala ke dasht mein ye kaisi barbadi huwi<br />
Shaadi ke ghar me hai maatam, kya sunaayein aapko</p>

<p>2. Girte hai uthte hai sarwar, kuch nazar aata nahi<br />
Laasha e akbar kahan hai koi batlaata nahi<br />
Aagayi&rsquo;n khaime se zainab, kya sunaayein aapko</p>

<p>3. Tukdhe tukdhe hogaya saara badan abbas ka<br />
Isliye aaya na laasha hazrat e abbas ka<br />
Maraya hai shere haider, kya sunaayein aapko</p>

<p>4. Ab bacha koi nahi hai haathon par besheer hai<br />
Paani ke badle me dekho hurmula ka teer hai<br />
Chid gaya hai halq e asghar kya sunaayein aapko</p>

<p>5. Baad e sarwar zainab o kulsoom par mushkil ye thi<br />
Ghash me the wo abid e muztar, behan sholo me thi<br />
Jal gaya bachchi ka kurta, kya sunaayein aapko</p>

<p>6. Jalti reti par litaaya asghar e masoom ko<br />
Na mila ek boond paani asghar e masoom ko<br />
Reh gaya bachcha tadhapkar , kya sunaayein aapko</p>

<p>7. Jo khuda ke hai wo bande, matam e sarwar me hai<br />
Murtuza tu hind me hai, aur ye dil karbal me hai<br />
Phir bulalo jald moula, kya sunaayein aapko</p>

